"""
================================================================
🤖 ORBIT ROBOT — Fused: Face Tracker + Venezuela Ambassador Bot
================================================================
Camera thread  : Tracks faces with MediaPipe, drives motors (L/R/C)
                 via serial to MegaPi.
Bot thread     : Full Embajador de Venezuela with wake-word "Orbit",
                 TTS (edge-tts/Elena), LLM via Gemini/Ollama.

How they interact
-----------------
* The camera loop runs on the MAIN thread at ~30 fps.
* The bot loop runs on a DAEMON thread.
* Both share one `bot_state` dict with a threading.Lock:
    bot_state["qqtalking"]  → True while TTS is playing  (motors pause)
    bot_state["active"]   → True while bot session is open
* A small CV overlay on the camera winqdow shows bot status.

Wake word
---------
"Orbit" is handled EXCLUSIVELY by the bot thread (Escuchar module).
The old inline mic-polling from cammovetest has been removed to
avoid mic contention.  Motor logic continues independently.
================================================================
"""

